{
  "summary": "Decompiled replay_stairs walks fixed-stride records, schedules commands, collects indices, reverses them, removes records by tail compaction, and drops per-tag payloads. Early return occurs when puVar33[3] is zero; a param1 write precedes it. Two separate lookups supply distinct payload fields.",
