      "refs": ["D1:L196-L205","D1:L218-L280","D1:L313-L327"]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "effect": "Write output record at base lVar8+0x28, index lVar35, stride 0x38: +0=*(lVar8+0x40); +8=final tag; +9..+0x27 assembled stack bytes; +0x28=CONCAT44(uVar67,uVar68) where zero if puVar31 null; +0x30=1. Then increment lVar8+0x30 and lVar8+0x40.",
      "refs": ["D1:L328-L333","D1:L489-L516"]
